{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1160909-how-to-portray-actions-longer-than-a-scene","id":1160909,"title":"How To portray actions longer than a scene?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-20T10:45:46-08:00","id":1160909,"title":"How To portray actions longer than a scene?","content":"Hi there all, long time fan of CofD, but never participated in a game. Because of that, there are some aspects that I haven't been able to really wrap my head around. The biggest ones are extended actions and doors-how do you portray them in-game? By extended actions, I mean ones that can go on for days or even weeks, the same goes for doors. I just can't figure out in my head how to connect dice rolls at the table to activities that can stretch out over significant in-game time, can anyone out there enlighten me?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7372-lady-gray","name":"Lady Gray","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7372_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-20T11:05:26-08:00","id":1160915,"title":"","content":"Generally speaking these kinds of actions are handled by downtime - you don't have to run your sessions in real time. So if someone is spending x amount of time trying to open Doors in SM, they simply describe the steps they take day by day or week by week, eg.<br /> <br /> 'I take him our to a nice dinner on Saturday night so we can discuss our interests. I casually mention the project I'm working on to see if he bites.' -&gt; Roll<br /> 'The next Monday, I arrange a meet up so we can talk about the specs -&gt; Roll<br /> I give him a call that Wednesday night after finishing with his proposed changes, to see if we're okay to proceed with production -&gt; Roll.<br /> <br /> The other players can chip in on how they choose to spend the downtime, providing narrative justification for certain merits, or taking on their own extended actions (research, crafting, etc).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T04:03:49-08:00","id":1161118,"title":"","content":"Thanks, that really helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7372-lady-gray","name":"Lady Gray","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7372_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T04:23:20-08:00","id":1161119,"title":"","content":"If such actions are handled in game, do a montage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T20:26:06-08:00","id":1161404,"title":"","content":"<b>Interesting problem is when you need to break those long actions with other activities - like character is trying. I don't know - take over the cities higher-ups and rest of gang need to run from the police, for example. </b>You know, one player have 'master plan' that can take weeks, but rest of the group needs to do action NOW. I think that best is simply makes 'master plan' to be written on separate note sheets - like 'Date XX.YY.ZZZZ - Vance take out 3 Doors of the Mayor, 2 to go for Master Plan TM' - and roll with much instant scene of rest group. Those complex manipulations, in the end, <i>will</i> come to effect later in chronicle.<br /> <br /> And remember you can also change any Social Maneuvering into one much harder instant roll of <i>Forcing the Doors</i> - you just risk you will not be able to make <i>another</i> attempt on this particular NPC, it's 'all or nothing' action then. Better is too grind slowly NPC with normal take, but sometimes you just need things <b>now</b>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T22:09:45-08:00","id":1161423,"title":"","content":"&quot;Taking over a city's elected officials&quot; is more involved than a generic extended action, it'd warrant a story, or even a chronicle. There's a reason Kindred never ghoul/blood-bind the mayor, but a trusted advisor instead, but by all means, work of gathering those allies and contacts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T23:22:57-08:00","id":1161432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1160909-how-to-portray-actions-longer-than-a-scene?p=1161423#post1161423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Taking over a city's elected officials&quot; is more involved than a generic extended action, it'd warrant a story, or even a chronicle. There's a reason Kindred never ghoul/blood-bind the mayor, but a trusted advisor instead, but by all means, work of gathering those allies and contacts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, split it into couple 'Taking over councilman X' actions - even each one of them would take at least VERY BIG Social Maneuvering, repeated for each one of councilman in city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T09:06:10-08:00","id":1161531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1160909-how-to-portray-actions-longer-than-a-scene?p=1161119#post1161119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If such actions are handled in game, do a <b>montage</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>...I had to!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vK4gv11PTI8\" data-code=\"vK4gv11PTI8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/vK4gv11PTI8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-23T12:27:27-08:00","id":1161939,"title":"","content":"These are all really useful pieces of advice, thank you all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7372-lady-gray","name":"Lady Gray","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7372_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}